    "scenesThatPass": [
      "BETH: BOO!\nELLIE: Beth, you bitch!\nBETH: Surprise sis.\nELLIE: When did you get into town?",
      "BETH: I’m sorry okay. You know when I’m on the road I get sucked in deep. This is one of those tours where I gotta eat, sleep and shit it, twenty …\nBETH: Come on El, we gotta talk about this properly.\nELLIE: Okay, let’s talk about how you breeze back into my world with your gifts and your cool Auntie shtick. But, I know the real you, the you who …",
      "ELLIE: You can sleep on the sofa tonight, but I gotta pack and move and...\nBETH: You’re right.\nBETH: I need some big sister advice real bad right now.\nELLIE: You want my advice? Check your fucking voicemails once in a while.",
      "ELLIE: Hey Bethy-boo. It’s El. Just calling to say hi and em...me and Jay...\nELLIE: I don’t blame you, I hate the sound of my own voice too.\nELLIE: What’s going on with you Beth?\nBETH: I screwed up, like I always do. And I need you to help me figure it out. Again.",
      "KASSIE: I think I pee’d my pants.\nBRIDGET: Is it warm?\nBRIDGET: It’s just soda."
    ]
